WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two hands lie on a table. Only one is yours.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Matched sight and touch can change how ownership feels.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
But another measure can move without that feeling.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A strong experience isn't the same as proof of its cause.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
That's why short meditation audio deserves an honest comparison.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try twelve minutes free. Then judge the seller's actual offer.
